        "title": "Prototype shorter cost comparison periods",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- add an opt-in setting for shorter 7, 30, and 90-day cost comparisons\n- derive every comparison from the existing daily snapshot, without widening scans or adding storage/network work\n- keep existing behavior unchanged by default and document the separate lifetime-ledger contract requested in #1708\n\n## Product decision\n\nRecommended: merge with the setting defaulting off. This gives #1500 a bounded implementation without increasing existing menu density or scan cost.\n\nAlternatives:\n\n1. default the setting on;\n2. retain only the tested aggregation model and defer presentation.\n\nThis draft intentionally does not claim a lifetime total. Local logs are incomplete and mutable, so #1708 needs an approved retention, ownership, deletion, and completeness contract before implementation.\n\n## Proof\n\n- focused cost/settings/model suite: 83 tests passed\n- localization catalog suite: 18 tests passed\n- `make check`\n- `make test`: all 44 shards passed\n- `./Scripts/package_app.sh`\n- packaged General settings UI verified locally with 90-day history and the comparison toggle enabled\n- autoreview: clean, no accepted/actionable findings\n\nRefs #1500\nRefs #1708\n",
